## Working method

The human user develops objectives and scholarly or domain judgements with Research. Operations implements accepted Implementation Briefs in the shared repository. Verification examines actual results and evidence, reports its complete finding first and only to the human user, and never produces corrections. Maintained project knowledge follows Promptotyping. A Vault outside this repository is used only when `knowledge/integration.md` configures it as an optional long-term source.

